Setup Instructions:
For most clients (Streamable HTTP):
{
"mcpServers": {
"deepwiki": {
"url": "https://mcp.devin.ai/mcp",
"headers": {
"Authorization": "Bearer <API_KEY>"
}
}
}
}
For Claude Code:
claude mcp add -s user -t http deepwiki https://mcp.devin.ai/mcp -H "Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>"
Full documentation:
https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp
